<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-CORBETT WINS WORLD MEN'S JAVELIN TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-CORBETT WINS WORLD MEN'S JAVELIN TITLE.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Aug 5 (Reuter) South African Marius Corbett won the world men's javelin gold medal on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Steve Backley of Britain took the silver and Greek Kostas Gatzioudis the bronze.</p>
</text>
